{"segs": ["PA_ja_177:1.3"], "en": "“We are surrounded on all sides;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_177:1.4"], "en": "how will there be liberation?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_177:2.1"], "en": "“Even for those with many duties,”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
